# Cloudflare Workers 靜態資產的 header（原 nginx 預設不設 Cache-Control，這裡維持不快取長期化）
# 預覽頁與文章文字：帶 charset，避免被以 Latin-1 解讀（nginx 的 .md 原為 octet-stream，會變成下載）
/*.html
  Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
/articles/*/
  Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
/articles/*/article.md
  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
/articles/*/data.json
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
/articles/*/embeds.json
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
